<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/19th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Maharajpur</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1843">1843</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a> · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gwalior-campaign">Gwalior campaign</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Maharajpur was fought on 29 December 1843 near Gwalior between a British army under Sir Hugh Gough and the forces of the Gwalior State. On the same day a second British force won at Punniar. The defeats led to a treaty that reduced Gwalior's army and placed the state firmly under British control.</p></div>
